CREOracleScheduleFuzz
├── An unset snapshot returns zero
├── Bootstrap accepts a completed snapshot independently of the timestamp
├── Each accepted snapshot must advance its block even when time does not advance
├── A delayed report and a newer completed snapshot can arrive at the same timestamp
├── Reports use four ABI words and legacy timestamp payloads are rejected
├── Maximum uint48 snapshot blocks are accepted
└── Snapshot block ABI words above uint48 are rejected before acceptance
